# The Shape of CSMCL.SPACE

*What is standing, what it holds, and how the pieces reach each other · as of 2026-08-08*

---

## Origin

Session began looking for where the Firmament was developed. It was found, in
sync, deployed. What emerged from the search was larger: the surfaces are
further along than assumed, the ops codex had drifted five months, and the
narrative problem that had been sitting unsolved — *how to convey the Companion
without explaining it* — resolved structurally rather than editorially.

---

