firmament.csmcl.space     200          entity canvas · Phase 1
nexus.csmcl.space         307 /webui   LightRAG · future community hub
everfold.csmcl.space      307          LightRAG · world corpus
chronicles.csmcl.space    307          LightRAG · the 7 entity voices
csmcl.space               200          landing · desktop → firmament
```

All on `69.62.117.12`. Verified DNS + https from outside; ports and services not
