## The shape, stated plainly

Two front-ends serving, three corpora standing, one narrative problem solved.
The understanding layer considerably exceeds the touchable surface — a risk
already named in `transmission.observatory-continuity.001`: *concept expands
faster than narrative.* Today's movement is the correct response to it: tune,
connect, bring online.

Of everything here, **only Nexus structurally requires other people to exist.**
Observatory, Firmament and the ship each work with an audience of one.
